      "writtenOn": "2023-11-27T15:10:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So the real problem is that we end up using more memory for MMIO page tables than what we had reserved for it (enough to map 1GiB with page granularity), which means we don\u0027t really have a choice and need to bring back the page recycling logic that aosp/2519852 and parents removed ... The CL as is might very well be addressing the symptoms rather than the root cause :/",
      "revId": "26b467a5514d6a5274908d5d4872bb3f37913af2",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "39787cf1_e97c3b7b",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1942270
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-11-27T15:59:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The problem is that you cannot know how much memory you will consume for MMIO mappings at the time of reserving the memory for the stage2 pagetables. You can only calculate based on the worst case scenario. For 4KB PAGE_SIZE, reserving 1GB of IPA space works just fine because you have to reserve enough space to be able to address 262144 pages, which is 514 pages for MMIO mappings.",
      "parentUuid": "44995190_6a658b80",
      "revId": "26b467a5514d6a5274908d5d4872bb3f37913af2",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "57510be5_cce7327d",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1569742
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-11-27T16:04:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yup, which is why we had the whole recycling logic, so that when we run out of pages, we unmap MMIO ranges from one side to map it the other side. It\u0027s not pretty and should hopefully not hit in practice, but I feel pretty bad not having that logic as without it we cannot guarantee forward progress ...",
      "parentUuid": "39787cf1_e97c3b7b",
      "revId": "26b467a5514d6a5274908d5d4872bb3f37913af2",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
